  "content": "<p>再也不用担心用船运输动物和村民会是个麻烦了。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>安装此模组后，你可以在乘坐船只时进行小跳跃，从而能够在水上和陆地之间穿梭，甚至可以攀爬小斜坡。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>今天就加入跳跃船俱乐部<strong>吧！</strong>并获得免费的水花效果！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>在这里查看实际效果&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fA4EAEFg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://imgur.com/a/A4EAEFg</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>或者在这里</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ISqDfYnSpv4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>需要帮助？&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3XJkb2puw\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/k3XJkb2puw</a></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>对应的Fabric版本在这里：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jumpy-boats-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jumpy-boats-fabric</a></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/A4EAEFg\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252flobstermods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://jonn.dk/akliz_banner_productivebees.png\" alt=\"赞助时间\"></a></p>",
